#
# comments  (function comments; grammar `# comment <addr8> <text>`)
# comment 001984c0 kwlnMain: kwlnInitPS2Systems; kwlnInitRenderer; kwlnInitMain; loop { root=kwlnRootCreateTask; kwlnInitGameData; RpRandomSeed(T0_COUNT); RpRandomSeedMT(T0_COUNT); while(kwlnTaskExists(root)) kwlnUpdate(); } (10#1.1, #3)
# comment 00197030 kwlnInitPS2Systems: SIF/CD init, IOP reboot with IOPRP310.IMG, INTC9 T0 overflow handler, T0_MODE=0x281 (BUSCLK/16, CUE, OVFE), T1_COUNT=0, 15x sceSifLoadModule, H_Pad_Init, H_Memcard_Init, GetThreadId (10#1.2)
# comment 00196fe0 kwlnT0OverflowHandler: INTC cause 9; acks T0_MODE.OVF (0x800) and adds 0x10000 to g_kwlnT0Overflow64 (10#1.2)
# comment 00197350 kwlnInitRenderer: RwEngineInit(8MiB) + RpPDSRegisterPipe x30; RwEngineOpen; RpSkySelectDeepZBuffer(0)=16-bit Z; RwEngineSetVideoMode(82: 640x448x32 NTSC interlace flags 0x203); RwResourcesSetArenaSize(0x380000); _rwDMAPreAlloc(0x280000); RwEngineStart -> SkyStart (GS init); kwlnInstallVsyncFieldGate; world/lights/camera(640x448, near 20, far 25600) (10#1.3)
# comment 00198010 kwlnInitMain: CDVD/sound/ADX init; sceGsSyncVCallback(kwlnGsSyncVCallback); ROFS init + 3 CVM volumes (10#1.4)
# comment 00197fe0 kwlnGsSyncVCallback: INTC2 (VBLANK_START) handler: ADXM_ExecVint(); sync; ei; return 0 (10#1.4)
# comment 001983a0 kwlnUpdate: one game frame. First call: T0_COUNT=0, T0_MODE=0x83 (HBLANK clock). Else: T0->g_kwlnFrameStartT0; CDVD/sound/pad update; screenshot combo; kwlnTaskMain; frame counters++ (10#3)
# comment 00199140 kwlnRootUpdateShowRasterTask: last draw task: RwCameraShowRaster (queues flip); T0 delta -> g_kwlnFrameDeltaHsync, g_kwlnCpuLoadPct = delta/520*100 (520 H-lines = 1/30 s budget); T0_COUNT=0 (10#3)
# comment 0019d320 kwlnVsyncFieldGate: INTC2 handler installed after RW's: returns -1 when GS_CSR.FIELD==0 (even field), 0 when odd. Inferred: gates the RW flip to even fields -> 30 fps lock in FIELD-mode interlace (10#3.1; verify in Phase 4)
# comment 0019d360 kwlnInstallVsyncFieldGate: _sceAddIntcHandler(2, kwlnVsyncFieldGate, 0) + EnableIntc(2); id -> g_kwlnVsyncGateHandlerId (10#1.3)
# comment 00197fb0 kwlnAdxErrorCallback: registered with ADXM_SetCbErr at 0x1980BC; printf of the ADX error (10#1.4)
# comment 004ca640 RwEngineStart: _rwDeviceSystemRequest(dGSkyDevice, 2=rwDEVICESYSTEMSTART)->SkyStart; request 3; _rwPluginRegistryInitObject(engineTKList); request 0x11 (_rwSkyOverloadPipelines) (10#1.3)
# comment 004c4c00 RwResourcesSetArenaSize: RwResourcesEmptyArena/_rwResHeapClose then _rwResHeapInit(size); called with 0x380000 (10#1.3)
# comment 004e1060 SkyStart: GS/DMA/VIF init. skyInitialClear (VRAM clear via GIF ch2); _rwSkyInitConfigSystem (VIF/GIF reset, sceDmaReset); sceGsSyncV; sceGsResetGraph(0,INTERLACE,NTSC,FIELD); sceGsSetDefDispEnv x2 (640x448 PSMCT32); sceGsSetDefDrawEnv/Env2 x2 (Z PSMZ16S); FBP 0/140, ZBP 280, texcache from page 350; flicker-free interlace (PMODE 0x8003, DBY=1); gs_set_up via VIF1 chain; sceGsSwapDBuffDc; _rwDMADmaOpen/_rwDMAHook; setInitialRenderState (10#2)
# comment 004d6b10 _rwSkyInitConfigSystem: VU1 FBRST|=0x200, VIF1_FBRST=1, VIF0_FBRST=1, GIF_CTRL=1, FBRST|=2; sceGsResetPath; sceDmaReset(1) (10#2)
# comment 004d6470 _rwDMAHook: sceAddIntcHandler(2,_rwDMAVSYNCHandler,0); sceAddDmacHandler(1|2,_rwDMAHandler,0); EnableIntc(2); EnableDmac(1,2); VIF0_ERR|=2; VIF1_ERR|=2; D_CTRL&=0xFFFFF8FD (10#2)
# comment 004d67b0 _rwDMADmaOpen: allocates the 0x280000-byte RW DMA buffer (two halves + 2KiB queue header), writes DMA tag templates, sets SPR base 0x70000000, calls _rwDMAHook (10#2)
# comment 004d4350 _rwDMAHandler: DMAC ch1/ch2 interrupt handler and inline driver (-1) of the RW software DMA queue: entry types 1 VIF1, 2 GIF, 0x21 VIF1+GIF image (GIF_MODE=4), 64/65 flip request, 66 counter, 79 callback, 127 wrap (10#3.1)
# comment 004d47f0 _rwDMAVSYNCHandler: INTC2 handler; on pending flip: reads CSR.FIELD, sceGsPutDispEnv(disp[buf]), writes DISPFB1/DISPLAY1 directly, kicks post-flip GIF chain or resumes queue via _rwDMAHandler(-1) (10#3.1)
# comment 004d5270 _rwDMAReqFlip: builds a 24-qword VIF1 packet and queues flip entry 64/65; drives the queue inline when idle (10#3)
# comment 004d4df0 _rwDMAForceBufferSwap: flushes the open SPR packet with D8 fromSPR, spins until the DMA queue drained and the flip was consumed (optional wait callback g_rwDMAWaitCallback), swaps DMA half-buffers, InvalidDCache (10#3.1)
# comment 004d53f0 _rwDMAWaitQueue: called from SkyCameraBeginUpdate/SkyCameraClear; forces the buffer swap when the previous frame is still queued (frame throttle) (10#3.1)
# comment 004d9460 SkyRasterShowRaster: skyTexCacheEndFrame; g_skyFrameCount++; _rwDMAReqFlip(&rwDMAFlipData, frame&1); _rpSkyFrameBufferRastersUpdate (10#3)
# comment 00488dd0 RpRandomSeed: seeds the LCG table (x*0x41C64E6D+0x3039, mult/mult1 pairs) and runs 0x136 warm-up RpRandom draws; seeded with T0_COUNT at 0x1984FC (10#3)
# comment 00488c70 RpRandomSeedMT: MT19937 state init (624 words, multiplier 69069); seeded with T0_COUNT at 0x19850C (10#3)
# comment 004241d0 Y_Misc_GetT0Count: returns T0_COUNT (0x10000000) (10#3)
# comment 005035f0 VSync: INTC_STAT=4; spin until INTC_STAT&4; INTC_STAT=4 (10#2)
# comment 00503680 VSync2: like VSync but also returns when the SetVSyncFlag (syscall 0x73) flag is raised (10#2)
# comment 00964990 rwDMAFlipData: RwSkyFlipData / sceGsDBuffDc: disp[2] @+0, giftag0 @+0x50, draw0 @+0x60 (FBP 140), draw02 @+0xE0, clear0 @+0x130, giftag1 @+0x1C0, draw1 @+0x1D0 (FBP 0), draw12 @+0x250, clear1 @+0x2A0, circuit-1 DISPFB/DISPLAY copies @+0x330 (10#2)
# comment 0077e710 videoModes: 90 RwVideoMode {w,h,depth,flags,refRate,format}; [82] @0x77EEC0 = 640x448x32 flags 0x203 60Hz = the mode the game selects (10#1.3)
# comment 007b5080 gs_set_up: VIF1 DMA chain sent by SkyStart: STCYCL(4,4)/STMASK 0/STMOD 0, DIRECT giftag A+D TEST_1=0x5140B, TEXA TA1=0x80, ALPHA_1=0x44; END (10#2)
# comment 00965770 skyInitialClear: 13-qword GIF packet (NREG=12 A+D) clearing all 4 MiB of VRAM: FRAME FBW=16, SCISSOR 1024x1024, sprite 0..4096x1024, sent via GIF ch2 normal mode (10#2)
